  Preskok %s (azuriran)
MSG_DEST_INCOMPLETE
  [odrediste nepotpuno: %ld/%ld bajta]
MSG_VERIFYING
  Provera %s ...
MSG_VERIFY_OK
 OK
MSG_VERIFY_FAIL
