SaferCopy: provera - greska citanja
MSG_VERIFY_SIZE_DIFF
SaferCopy: provera - razlicite velicine (%ld vs %ld)
MSG_VERIFY_CONTENT
SaferCopy: provera - razlicit sadrzaj
MSG_SUMMARY_HEADER
--- Pregled: %ld greska(e) ---
MSG_ERRBUF_TRUNCATED
  [%ld poruka(e) skracena - bafer gresaka pun]
